#: ../../casageo.logistics.rst:43 ../../casageo.logistics.rst:115
msgid ""
"Navigation coordinates corresponding to the waypoint. Instead of a "
"geometry object, you may also specify this as two separate fields "
"``position_latitude`` and ``position_longitude`` of type :class:`float`. "
"**Required**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.logistics.rst:48 ../../casageo.logistics.rst:120
msgid "streetposition : :class:`~shapely.Point`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.logistics.rst:49 ../../casageo.logistics.rst:121
msgid ""
"Coordinates of the destination corresponding to the waypoint, if any. "
"This is used to select the the correct side of the street where "
"necessary. Instead of a geometry object, you may also specify this as two"
" separate fields ``streetposition_latitude`` and "
"``streetposition_longitude`` of type :class:`float`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.logistics.rst:55
msgid "placename"
msgstr ""

#: ../../casageo.logistics.rst:56
msgid ""
"Name of the target destination to select between multiple destinations "
"near the same location."
msgstr ""

